  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/iobcat1/). VERDICT: CURRENT. Review 2026-11-01 on 100b6fbb6e: the item's exact repro still emits f -> rust:std::fs:0-0:write for buf.write on a Vec, and io-boundaries reports fs_write std::fs.write x2 (sources f and g). The cited branch moved from rust.py:2879 to rust.py:3736 'elif callee_name in use_aliases:' and still has no method-call guard; the 2026-10-30 WI-silam/WI-lirik rust changes did not touch it. MECHANISM: method-call name looked up in the file's use-alias map without checking call shape. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-hilib,WI-lijab."  # 80d7
